<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<xmi:XMI xmlns:uml="http://schema.omg.org/spec/UML/2.1" xmlns:xmi="http://schema.omg.org/spec/XMI/2.1" xmi:version="2.1">
  <xmi:Documentation exporter="Enterprise Architect" exporterVersion="6.5" exporterID="1721" />
  <uml:Model xmi:type="uml:Model" xmi:id="EAID_97354E57_4B28_5FC2_B93D_6D1EC5C2AE54" name="EA_Model" visibility="public">
    <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="EAPK_CA162FBB_B001_5368_99D3_0ADF31FF91D6" name="Luoc do 3.09 - Use case hoan ve hoan tien va huy su kien" visibility="public">
      <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_A1E021FC_27F1_554B_A6C6_44114093A772">
        <body>Nguon: BAOCAO.md muc3.1-3.4; SPEC.md muc6.9, muc6.10. Day la goi doc lap de nhap vao Sparx Enterprise Architect.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Actor" xmi:id="EAID_47A6321F_4EFC_5122_AA92_2B895D1EF3C5" name="Nguoi mua da xac minh email" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_8F4B90D7_129A_5C66_8EDD_ECEF93F64218">
          <body>Nguon: BAOCAO.md muc3.1; SPEC.md muc4.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Actor" xmi:id="EAID_5103D0FA_4ADC_561A_958F_8579116CC337" name="Quan tri nen tang" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_01B1DA74_7D49_5FD9_A445_271E53B4611E">
          <body>Nguon: BAOCAO.md muc3.1; SPEC.md muc4.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_C72251F0_0A1D_565C_BCE8_D225FF6080A9" name="Gui yeu cau hoan ve va xem ket qua" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_E3BE2640_08DA_5F69_B7B8_841C29B1BFB5">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.15: Chu don chon ve ACTIVE cung Order truoc startTime, chua co nghia vu mo; tao Refund REQUESTED/CUSTOMER_REFUND, amount = tong paidAmount va chuyen ve REFUND_PENDING. Refund giu nghia vu va lan xu ly hien hanh, khong co RefundRequest nghiep vu rieng.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc6.9, muc6.10.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_29AA6568_643E_5863_9DF5_95356E1A1E8D" name="Duyet hoac tu choi yeu cau hoan ve" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_77861453_0CCD_592E_9AC8_0082035F21FA">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.28: Quan tri quyet dinh Refund REQUESTED sang APPROVED/REJECTED. Tu choi can ly do va chi khoi phuc ve neu Event chua huy; duyet chua dong nghia da hoan. Hoan 0d completeWithoutTransfer, van giu Refund, hoan tat ve/tra kho ma khong tao chuyen tien.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc6.9, muc6.10.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_0B204325_B104_5018_BD49_12B4CB2E3EB2" name="Xu ly hoan tien mo phong" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_4F1E26BE_E2AE_53A6_AB66_D7D3D9C94A79">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.29: Refund.beginAttempt(attemptId) giu currentAttemptId va PROCESSING; recordAttemptResult: SUCCEEDED -> COMPLETED/tra kho, FAILED -> RETRYABLE, UNKNOWN -> NEEDS_RECONCILIATION. RefundTransferLog la lich su ky thuat; ID lap khong hoan hai lan, UNKNOWN phai doi chieu truoc thu moi.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc6.9, muc6.10.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:UseCase" xmi:id="EAID_CB9EBCD9_3996_5EA3_BD9D_2E4ADD536E4A" name="Huy su kien" visibility="public">
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="EAID_21A2BCCB_1415_54E9_AA42_55C63DD0AB16">
          <body>BAOCAO.md muc3.4.30: Quan tri huy Event PUBLISHED truoc startTime, dung ban/check-in, giai phong Hold va quota coupon; tiep tuc/tao Refund EVENT_CANCELLATION theo Order cho ve du dieu kien, khong trung nghia vu. Ve USED la ngoai le can quan tri xu ly, khong tu hoan.
Doi chieu: SPEC.md muc6.9, muc6.10.</body>
        </ownedComment>
      </packagedElement>
